#### `actions.getOrCreateConnectedAccount`
```typescript
getOrCreateConnectedAccount(params: {
  connectionName: string;        // REQUIRED
  identifier: string;            // REQUIRED
  authorizationDetails?: CreateConnectedAccount['authorizationDetails'];
