## 6. Type Definitions for Tool Execution Results

### `Tool` type
```typescript
type Tool = {
  id: string;
  provider: string;
  definition?: JsonObject;    // google.protobuf.Struct → MCP tool definition
  metadata?: JsonObject;       // google.protobuf.Struct → tool metadata
  tags: string[];
